// ─── SMART STRUCTURAL DECODER ────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Decodes ANY valid OBD-II code from its structure when not found in the explicit DB.
// OBD-II format: [System][Type][Subsystem][NN]
//   System:    P=Powertrain, B=Body, C=Chassis, U=Network
//   Type:      0=SAE generic, 1=Manufacturer, 2=SAE generic, 3=Manufacturer
//   Subsystem: 0-9,A-F (varies by system letter)

